---
title: Order state dimensions — payment + fulfilment (partial overview)
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> payment_unreported
    payment_unreported --> payment_reported : buyer reports
    payment_reported --> payment_seller_confirmed : seller confirms
    payment_reported --> payment_unresolved : 24h silence
    payment_unreported --> payment_unresolved : late report
    payment_unresolved --> payment_seller_confirmed : verified + allocated
    payment_unresolved --> refund_requested : allocation lost
    payment_unresolved --> payment_established_unpaid : established
    [*] --> stock_reserved : atomic reservation
    stock_reserved --> stock_released : unpaid expiry
    stock_reserved --> dispatched : payment confirmed
    dispatched --> receipt_confirmed : buyer confirms
    dispatched --> delivery_evidenced : carrier / handover
    dispatched --> delivery_unconfirmed : evidence window lapse
